  "title": "Old-Fashioned Cracker Dressing",
  "description": "This old-fashioned cracker dressing recipe is made with saltine crackers, celery, onions, and herbs, it&#39;s a simple and satisfying side dish for poultry.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
